DESCRIPTION:Pizza tailgate outside at 6:30\, meeting at 7:00. The Open Seats petition is voted on by the electors physically present\, after a short district budget review.\n\nNo photo ID needed. You just sign in as an eligible elector. Free parking on site. Home by about 7:45.\n\nMore info: https://openseatsmcpasd.org/sept22\nQuestions: chase.chasephillips@gmail.com
